I'm only investing an afternoon. She takes in the landscape, breathing in the lovely isolation.
ຂ້ອຍພຽງແຕ່ລົງທືນຕອນບ່າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ.
ນາງມັກທັດສະນີຍະພາບ, ດູດຫາຍໃຈໃນຄວາມໂດດດ່ຽວທີ່ສວຍງາມ.

373
00:26:19,700 --> 00:26:21,700
[GABRIELLA]
Where are we?
ພວກເຮົາຢູ່ໃສ?

374
00:26:22,200 --> 00:26:26,750
[JASON]
My father used to bring me here. She hears something in his tone.
ພໍ່ຂອງຂ້ອຍເຄີຍພາຂ້ອຍມາບ່ອນນີ້.
ນາງໄດ້ຍິນບາງສິ່ງບາງຢ່າງໃນສຽງຂອງລາວ.

375
00:26:27,250 --> 00:26:30,050
[GABRIELLA]
No more? Jason concentrates on securing the boat.
ບໍ່ອີກບໍ? ເຈຊອນສຸມໃສ່ການຮັກສາເຮືອ.

376
00:26:30,550 --> 00:26:34,050
[JASON]
He's dead. He drowned in a storm. She shivers involuntarily.
ລາວຕາຍແລ້ວ. ລາວຈົມໃນລົມພາຍຸ. ນາງສັ່ນສະເທືອນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ.

377
00:26:34,550 --> 00:26:36,550
[JASON]
He was a fisherman.
ລາວເປັນນັກຫາປາ.

378
00:26:37,050 --> 00:26:41,250
[GABRIELLA]
I don't know if I would like boats after that. He smiles.
ຂ້ອຍບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າຂ້ອຍຢາກມີເຮືອຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນບໍ. ລາວມ່ວນຊື່ນ.

379
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:45,250
[JASON]
I feel close to him when I'm on the water.
ຂ້ອຍຮູ້ສຶກໃກ້ກັບລາວເມື່ອຂ້ອຍຢູ່ເທິງນ້ ໍາ.

380
00:26:45,750 --> 00:26:47,750
[GABRIELLA]
How old were you?
ເຈົ້າອາຍຸຫຼາຍປານໃດ?

381
00:26:48,250 --> 00:26:54,250
[JASON]
-- Eight. I'd just turned eight. She takes his hand. He tightens his fingers through hers and looks out at the horizon, trying to control the emotions her sympathy has roiled. Gabriella senses this. She puts her arms around him, kisses him on the cheek. They stand, holding each other. Then Jason, on impulse, kisses her on the lips.
