. ແກບຣີເລລາຮູ້ສຶກສິ່ງນີ້. ນາງເອົາແຂນຂອງນາງຢູ່ອ້ອມລາວ, ຈູບລາວໃສ່ກະຕ່າ. ພວກເຂົາຢືນ, ຈັບກັນແລະກັນ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈາຊອນ, ໂດຍການກະຕຸ້ນ, ຈູດນາງໃສ່ປາກ.

382
00:26:54,750 --> 00:27:00,750
[VICTOR]
- Beautiful. Unusual cut. Look at the fire. Hold it up to the light. He hands the necklace to Alex, who lifts it up to look at it. Victor reaches into a drawer. In itHttheeree'ss a gun and a camera. He takes out the camera. necklace. The flash jerks Alex's picture of Alex with gaze from the
